<BaseLayout
  title="About & Methodology — WasPetInsuranceWorthIt.com"
  description="How we calculate whether pet insurance was worth it. Our methodology, data sources, and assumptions explained."
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">About & Methodology</h1>
  <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg">
    This calculator uses real premium data from NAPHIA (North American Pet Health Insurance Association)
    and actual veterinary cost benchmarks to give you an honest, data-driven answer about whether
    pet insurance made financial sense for your pet. Our methodology and data sources are fully
    transparent and updated every six months.
  </p>
